pve-tools (1.8.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release published as a Debian package via the openSUSE Build
    Service, as an alternative to the manual copy procedure. Bundled tools:
    - pve-import-cloud-images 1.3.0
    - pve-vmnic-fix 1.0.0
    - pve-create-tshoot-image 1.3.0
    - pve-sdn-healthcheck 1.0.0 (new since 1.7.0)
  * Install scripts to /usr/sbin, man pages to /usr/share/man/man8,
    and bash completion to /usr/share/bash-completion/completions.

